  "problem": "Consider the matrix $A$ given below.\nWhich entries of $A$ could be replaced by $0$ in order to get a matrix in row echelon form?\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & 4 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 5 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
